          "urpx:description": "For all domestic uses of a residential service when supplied through one meter, as the Cooperative's Service Rules and Regulations define a residential service. Also available to all existing church facilities and any church facility with a transformer size of less than 100 kVA connected after January 1, 2016. Available to all qualified customers in the area served by the Cooperative.",
